    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "We regret to inform you that Their Master's Voice with John Malkovich has been canceled, and ticket holders will be contacted shortly regarding refund procedures. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n******************************\n\nTheir Master’s Voice is an impressive and unclassifiable show starring a true legend, actor John Malkovich. In this international production set in 1725, he is joined on stage by two opera singers, an actress, baroque musicians, and a 12-voice choir.\n\nJohn Malkovich, known worldwide for his unique personality and voice, plays the..."
      }
    ],
